dssp
------------------------------------------
Create DSSP files

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcifpp10-10.0.4-1bl2
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libmcfp2-2.1.1-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libCatch2-devel-3.16.1-1bl2
  libcifpp-10.0.4-1bl2
  libcifpp-devel-10.0.4-1bl2
  libmcfp-devel-2.1.1-1bl1
  libsqlite3-devel-3.49.1-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/PDB-REDO/dssp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/PDB-REDO/dssp/archive/refs/tags/v4.6.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack dssp-4.6.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./dssp-4.6.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/dssp-4.6.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/dssp-4.6.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(dssp)
  /usr/bin/mkdssp.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/dssp.README
  /usr/share/doc/dssp/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/dssp/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/dssp/changelog
  /usr/share/libcifpp/dssp-extension.dic
  /usr/share/man/man1/mkdssp.1.gz

